{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Radio Heart: Lofi Hours</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A </i>focus tool,\u00a0<i>soulful ambient space to relax, reflect, and focus with lofi warmth guiding every moment.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lofi Radio Soundtrack</strong>- Curated chill beats and ambient radio sounds to help you focus, relax, or daydream.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mood Journal &amp; Daily Notes</strong> - Write your thoughts, track your emotions, and reflect in a gentle, pressure-free way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Avatar customization -\u00a0</strong>Choose from a variety of hairstyles, outfits, and color options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Room customization </strong>-<strong>\u00a0</strong>Choose from a variety of furniture, wallpapers, outfits, and color options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soft Focus Tools</strong> - Built-in Pomodoro timer and to-do list designed to keep you gently on track.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>XP System</strong> -Earn XP as you take care of yourself \u2014 journaling, staying present, or just listening.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Photo mode</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Ambience</strong> - Background sounds like rain, night wind, and vinyl crackle that respond to your mood.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Pressure, No Deadlines</strong> - Just you, a little music, and a space to feel calm in.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Different Calming Environments</strong><i></i></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3927050?t=1772434298","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927050/8ba2cd425904bd9fc666bbb89ea7e2a08f73861